			"notes": "# DeathSound Broadcast v26.2-1.0.2\n\n- Adds compatibility with Minecraft 26.2.\n- Targets Fabric Loader 0.19.3 and Fabric API 0.155.2+26.2 on Java 25.\n- Preserves server-only installation: connecting clients do not need the mod.\n- Continues broadcasting the configured sound through Fabric's server entity death event."
