			"notes": "## DeathSound Broadcast 26.1.2.-1.0.1\n\nPorted to Minecraft 26.1.2 with official Mojang mappings.\n\n### Highlights\n\n- Server-authoritative death sound broadcasts through Fabric server entity events.\n- Configurable hearing range and death sound.\n- Reload configuration without restarting with /deathsoundbroadcast reload.\n- Vanilla and unmodified clients can connect; the mod is required only on the server.\n- Removed obsolete client-side and Mixin scaffolding.\n\n### Requirements\n\n- Minecraft 26.1.2\n- Java 25\n- Fabric Loader 0.19.3 or newer\n- Fabric API 0.154.2+26.1.2\n\n### Installation\n\nInstall Fabric Loader and Fabric API on the server, place the DeathSound Broadcast JAR in the server mods directory, then configure deathsoundbroadcast.toml as needed."
		},
